    {
      "version": "0.5.0",
      "date": "2026-10-27T14:08:52.556Z",
      "notes": "- Routines: checklists that come back every day, weekday, Monday, week or month. Each period creates a task with one sub-task per step, kept as the routine's history; a Routines view lists open occurrences and routines (pause, resume, end, history), the Calendar shows each day's routines and the Desktop can show a routines board with tickable steps. CLI: nexus routine.\n- Settings are split into tabs and sub-tabs (Appearance, Fields, Profiles, Data, CLI & Agents, About), and remember the last one per profile.\n- Settings → CLI & Agents downloads the agent skills for the nexus CLI as a zip.\n- Date inputs get Today / Tomorrow / Next week buttons; the due date is a date only; new custom field types Date and Date and time.\n- Desktop: ten note colours, one font for all notes, deleting a note asks first; Add a task skips completed tasks while they are hidden; a task sent back no longer brings its put-away folder out.",
